note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note om/gpu/engine/runtime.om: Universal Pure Seeded-OM-2 Zero-CUDA GPU Runtime for ANY Dense/Hybrid Model.
note Dynamically sizes UVM workspaces, loads tensors by canonical name from any safetensors layout,
note quantizes BF16 or FP8 weights to W4 block-32 on GPU, specializes SM121 SASS kernels via emit_generic.om,
note and records GPFIFO packets for 128K-context decode & OpenAI HTTP serving.

const ENG_MAX_LAYERS ulong 128
const ENG_WORK_BYTES ulong 92274688
const ENG_SCRATCH_BYTES ulong 402653184

